{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：AI与GPU与DRAM与NAND技术与相关数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span> 11月数据中心观察给出的主线并不复杂：AI用量还在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>，但支出没有跟着同比例增长。OpenRouter上付费token量环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79%</span>、同比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54倍</span>，估算总支出却只增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26倍</span>。用量与花费之间出现差距，来自模型结构向低价开源权重模型倾斜。这份报告较有信息量的地方，不是“AI需求强”这个结论，而是它把用量、单价、支出三条线拆开，让读者看到需求<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>和商业变现之间并不同步。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/UVpibWicuGd9RPxsZG2h7q7tEYzJMBTFAGJPMN8KEdQ574BKatYzJF69Fu3m9bzmmv4FfoTwCRek7w1e9I9em24c0KzlMzOGd2L4D8QiasjEXQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UVpibWicuGd9TBN1FichN9FCrdbI01Tg1SOkDvamtOub2duWiaDTxXyhbHicf0R8XxwYntiakV6FeibQz7gjvKqJBwS8icEFIc0ovYUjXoE0kTRBEm0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UVpibWicuGd9QvbK9CVm7x7j3y1iaAyKM7iaIoKoLzHLbNKLsJAsILB9MgvvMkXfX2AgpjiaB8VsolQ815JYlHldfmvkRp6tBciceKLic6OrKLvXdc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Mia<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/UVpibWicuGd9RmBCWejD53tCRKwL7M9z4Huaw6J6c6A5TC8ZsF5PyrCRD98G3Pib51CiajCwKnic7XQmypo5s94JYBSjPEC2mz35qlaJ5FC1sEA4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 28-J.P. Morgan-Hardware - Networking-Data Center Watch- Strong AI Usage Meets a LowerPriced Model Mix in November- GPU Rental Prices Rise as DRAM and NAND Diverge-261123</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
